# One Pavilion demo surface (critical)

Customer-facing product name is **Pavilion**. Legacy hosts may still say `commons-*`.

Do **not** treat demo and trial as two products to deploy.

| Surface | Role |
|---------|------|
| **commons-pto-demo** | Pavilion product demo / trials (one Vercel stack). Riverside sample + brand packs. |
| **commons-pto** | Legacy private host. Do not open new prospects here. |
| **Stone Hill / shmspto** | **Customer #1** — dedicated treasurer deploy. Not the product author. |

## Sales motion

1. Share the demo: `https://demo.onpavilion.com` (or legacy `commons-pto-demo.vercel.app`)
2. Brand it: `/review?brand=spring-hill` or banner / review “Brand this tour”
3. Tour staff/member depth: `/review` + review code (sales-sent links only)
4. Continue → unlock private login / connectors = **trial** (`{slug}.onpavilion.com`), not a second Vercel project

## Agent rules

- Ship product to **commons-pto-demo** unless Rob asks otherwise.
- Brand packs: `frontend/lib/crm/trial-packs/`
- Cookie `pavilion_brand` + `/api/demo/brand`
- Never `vercel link` this repo to treasurer
- Demo ship does **not** update www.shmspto.org — promote + SHMS ship does
